  "info": {
    "title": "Synthwave",
    "author": "Atomik Rack factory",
    "notes": "A night-drive synthwave track in A minor at 108 BPM: bright tonal drums with the kick on its own track, a pumping octave bass that ducks from the kick, the four-chord loop on a wide string pad, a plucked arpeggio and a neon hook, with a big hall and a dotted echo. The first verse has no arpeggio: bring it in earlier or later. Swap the pad for another factory patch, or add a second hook in the break."
  },
